(lang dune 3.21)

; Active only when this directory is copied out as its own project:
; dune reads the workspace file at the workspace root, so inside
; windtrap's tree this file is inert and the README's commands carry
; --instrument-with instead. Standalone, it declares once what every
; command was repeating — both backends on for the default context —
; and the flag disappears from the whole README. The built program's
; meaning never changes: coverage marks only count, and a mutant
; changes meaning only in a forked child that armed it.

(context
 (default
  (instrument_with ppx_windtrap.coverage ppx_windtrap.mutate)))
